      "text": "The Lord upholds. (1) King of Israel; the chief events of his reign were his joint maritime expedition with Jehoshaphat (2 Chr. 20:35–37) and the revolt of Moab (see Moabite Stone) (2 Kgs. 1:2; 3:4–5; see also 1 Kgs. 22:40, 49–53; 2 Kgs. 1).",
